Description: Parrot GNU/Linux custom menu
 This package provides the common menu infrastructure for Parrot GNU/Linux.
 .
 It is used by any desktop that complies with the Freedesktop menu
 specification at http://standards.freedesktop.org/menu-spec/menu-spec-1.0.html

Package: parrot-menu-security
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, parrot-menu (>= ${source:Version})
Breaks: parrot-menu (<< ${source:Version})
Replaces: parrot-menu (<< ${source:Version})
Description: Parrot GNU/Linux security menu entries
 This package provides the Parrot Security menu, desktop directories, and
 launcher templates for security tools.
 .
 Install this package on Parrot Security Edition, or as an explicit opt-in on
 Parrot Home Edition, to expose security tool launchers without installing the
 tools themselves.
